{%- comment -%}
  Which theme film shows this product. Outputs the asset base name
  (assets/<name>.mp4 + assets/<name>-poster.webp) or nothing.
  One list for the whole theme: the home chapters, the product page and
  About all read it, so a film is only ever shown with its own product.

  Usage: {%- capture film -%}{% render 'film-name', handle: product.handle %}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  case handle
    when 'valeria-leather-shoulder-bag'
      echo 'film-valeria'
    when 'isadora-leather-shoulder-bag'
      echo 'film-isadora'
    when 'amelie-suede-leather-tote-bag'
      echo 'film-amelie'
    when 'bennett-leather-zip-wallet'
      echo 'film-bennett'
    when 'varen-mechanical-leather-card-holder'
      echo 'film-varen'
    when 'arden-leather-magnetic-card-holder'
      echo 'film-arden'
    when 'soren-leather-card-holde'
      echo 'film-soren'
  endcase
-%}
